# Real student identifiers -- NEVER commit. functions/uids.json maps 30 Firebase UIDs to OpenStack
# project ids; it was produced while auditing the slot pool and sat UNTRACKED-BUT-COMMITTABLE for a
# day (git check-ignore matched nothing, so a stray `git add functions/` would have published real
# uids). Never committed -- verified with `git log --all -- functions/uids.json` = 0 commits.
# Archived at _archive/sensitive-untracked-2026-08-01/ rather than deleted.
